@startuml
actor Learner
participant "Angular training page" as UI
participant TrainingController as Controller
participant TrainingService as Service
participant DeckRepository as Decks
participant CardRepository as Cards
participant ReviewLogRepository as Reviews

== Select card ==
Learner -> UI: Start training
UI -> Controller: POST /api/decks/{deckId}/train/start (JWT)
Controller -> Service: nextCardResult(userId, deckId)
Service -> Decks: findByIdAndOwnerId(deckId, userId)
Decks --> Service: owned Deck
Service -> Cards: find oldest new, else earliest due
Cards --> Service: Card or none
Service --> Controller: TrainingNextResponse
Controller --> UI: 200 {hasCard, reason, card}

== Review card ==
Learner -> UI: Reveal answer and choose GOOD
UI -> Controller: POST /api/cards/{cardId}/review {rating: GOOD}
Controller -> Service: reviewCard(userId, cardId, GOOD)
Service -> Cards: findById(cardId)
Cards --> Service: Card
Service -> Decks: verify card's deck owner
Service -> Service: now; intervalDays = 7
Service -> Reviews: save ReviewLog(card, GOOD, now)
Service -> Service: transaction dirty-checks Card schedule
Service --> Controller: TrainingCardResponse
Controller --> UI: 200 updated schedule
UI -> Controller: POST /api/decks/{deckId}/train/next

@enduml
